# playDeselectSound(Player player)
# Plays the "piece deselected" sound. Fires when a previously-
# selected piece is no longer the selected piece (i.e. when the
# player clicks a different own piece, before the new piece's
# selectSound). CHANGE the sound name below.

@using rychess
@fast

@bypass /playsound minecraft:ui.button.click master @s -9134.0 -61.0 9669.0 1 0.8
